Things for Sunrise

A port of Things 0.3.3 by glisco.
Original source: https://github.com/glisco03/things
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide, with the rules re-implemented in Rust, and to Sunrise by arismoko, on Sunrise's
typed mod API (no game patches, no Java code). The items, blocks, textures, models and data are carried over from
the original jar. This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in
LICENSE.
